# Cerberus system user for the vsock-watch detective control. Installed to
# /usr/lib/sysusers.d/cerberus-vsock-watch.conf and applied by
# %sysusers_create_compat in the spec's %pre. See cerberus.sysusers for why
# shipping this file is required rather than optional.
#
# A DIFFERENT account than cerberus-api's "cerberus" user: a compromise of the
# cerberus account alone must not also blind this watcher. See
# docs/vsock-connect-detection.md §4.3.
#
# Home is "-" (sysusers.d's no-home default) rather than /etc/cerberus: that
# directory belongs to the cerberus account, and two service accounts sharing a
# home undercuts the very isolation this account exists for.
#Type Name           ID GECOS                                    Home Shell
u     cerberus-audit -  "Cerberus VSOCK-watch detective control" -    /sbin/nologin
